<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-RUBIN WINS AUSTRIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RUBIN WINS AUSTRIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>LINZ, Austria 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the</p>
<p>women's Austrian Open on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat 2-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
